<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Shreety’s Waiting Room</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;600;700&family=Quicksand:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute"><symbol id="b" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path d="M18 20 2 8v24zM22 20l16-12v24z"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="5"/></symbol></svg>
<svg class="bow" style="top:12%;left:6%;fill:var(--plum);transform:rotate(-15deg)"><use href="#b"/></svg>
<svg class="bow" style="bottom:10%;right:7%;transform:rotate(12deg)"><use href="#b"/></svg>
<canvas id="fx" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

<div id="gate">
  <h1>Knock knock…</h1>
  <p>Who’s there? Whisper the secret word, Shreety.</p>
  <form id="gf"><input id="pw" type="password" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Secret word" placeholder="Secret word"><button class="btn" type="submit">Knock</button></form>
  <div id="err" role="alert"></div>
</div>

<div id="app" hidden>
<nav id="nav">
  <button data-t="door" aria-current="true">The Door</button>
  <button data-t="sikkim">Sikkim Trip</button>
  <button data-t="home">Home Plans</button>
  <button data-t="game">Game Zone</button>
  <button data-t="music">Music Corner</button>
  <button data-t="photos">Photos</button>
  <button data-t="wish">Make a Wish</button>
</nav>
<button class="btn" id="mute" aria-label="Mute music">🔊</button>

<section class="wrap fit" id="t-door">
  <h1>Please wait outside</h1>
  <p class="sub">You made me wait outside my room. Now you wait outside yours.</p>
  <div class="scene">
    <div class="deco" id="deco"><span class="peek" style="left:-28px;top:-14px">🎈</span><span class="peek" style="right:-28px;top:22%;animation-delay:.8s">🎀</span><span class="peek" style="left:-24px;bottom:8%;animation-delay:1.4s">🎉</span></div>
    <div class="her" id="her"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Shreety waiting outside the door"><i class="tr" style="left:30%;top:52%">💧</i><i class="tr t2" style="left:68%;top:62%">💧</i><span class="bub">😭 Let me in!</span></div>
    <div class="room"><h2>Happy Birthday, Shreety!</h2><p>You’re 23 now. Come on in.</p></div>
    <div class="door" id="door"><div class="sign">Decorating in progress<small>No peeking!</small></div><div class="knob"></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="mat">Welcome (after you wait)</div>
  <div class="cd" id="cd"></div>
  <p class="hint" id="cdmsg">until the door opens at midnight</p>
</section>

<section class="wrap" id="t-sikkim" hidden>
  <h2>Sikkim itinerary</h2><p class="hint">Add days and the places or plans for each one.</p>
  <div id="p-sikkim"></div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" id="t-home" hidden>
  <h2>When I’m back home</h2><p class="hint">What shall we do when I come home?</p>
  <div id="p-home"></div>
</section>

<section class="wrap fit" id="t-game" hidden>
  <div class="gsub" id="gsub"><button data-g="cake" aria-current="true">Cake Catch</button><button data-g="match">Memory Match</button><button data-g="coupon">Coupons</button></div>
  <div class="gp" id="g-cake">
    <p class="hint">Catch fries, cake, watermelon and ice cream. Dodge the bugs. Drag or use arrow keys.</p>
    <canvas id="gc" width="320" height="420"></canvas>
    <p><b id="sc">Score: 0</b> · <span id="bs">Best: 0</span></p>
    <button class="btn" id="play">Play (30 seconds)</button>
  </div>
  <div class="gp" id="g-match" hidden>
    <p class="hint">Flip two cards at a time and find all the pairs!</p>
    <div class="gsub" id="mpairs"><button data-n="6">6 pairs</button><button data-n="8">8 pairs</button><button data-n="10">10 pairs</button><button data-n="12">12 pairs</button></div>
    <div class="mg" id="mgrid"></div>
    <p><b id="mmoves">Moves: 0</b> · <span id="mbest"></span></p>
    <button class="btn" id="mnew">New game</button>
  </div>
  <div class="gp" id="g-coupon" hidden>
    <p class="hint" id="chint"></p>
    <div class="cprog" id="cprog"></div>
    <div id="cstat"></div>
    <div id="scratch" hidden></div><div id="creveal" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div class="row"><button class="btn" id="copen">Get coupon</button><button class="btn alt" id="cmega" hidden>Claim MEGA coupon 👑</button></div>
    <div class="clist" id="clist"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" id="t-music" hidden>
  <h2>Music corner</h2>
  <div class="mgrid">
    <div class="player">
      <div class="vinyl" id="vinyl"><i>♥</i></div>
      <div id="np">Press play when you’re ready</div>
      <input type="range" id="seek" min="0" max="100" value="0" aria-label="Seek">
      <div class="ctrl"><button class="btn" id="prev" aria-label="Previous song">⏮</button><button class="btn sk" id="back10" aria-label="Back 10 seconds">↺10</button><button class="btn big" id="pp" aria-label="Play or pause">▶</button><button class="btn sk" id="fwd10" aria-label="Forward 10 seconds">10↻</button><button class="btn" id="next" aria-label="Next song">⏭</button></div>
      <p class="hint">Volume</p><input type="range" id="vol" min="0" max="100" value="70" aria-label="Volume">
    </div>
    <aside class="queue" id="queue" aria-label="Up next" hidden><h3>Up next</h3><ol id="q"></ol></aside>
  </div>
  <div class="addsong" id="addsong" hidden><b>Want more songs?</b> This playlist is collaborative, so add your own favourites!<br><a class="btn alt sm" id="plink" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Add songs to the playlist</a></div>
  <div id="yt"><div id="ytp"></div></div>
  <p class="hint" id="nopl" hidden>The playlist isn’t connected yet. Ask Shreety’s friend to add it!</p>
</section>
<section class="wrap fit" id="t-photos" hidden>
  <h2>Photo drop 📸</h2>
  <p class="sub">Add your favourite photos here: cute ones, funny ones, anything you love. They’re going into your birthday surprise, so shh!</p>
  <div class="pol"><div style="--r:-6deg">🌸</div><div style="--r:3deg">🍟</div><div style="--r:-3deg">🎀</div></div>
  <a class="btn big2" id="photoLink" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Upload your photos</a>
  <p class="hint">Opens Google Drive in a new tab.</p>
</section>
<section class="wrap fit" id="t-wish" hidden>
  <h2>Make a wish 🕯️</h2>
  <p class="sub">Type your wish, light the candle, then blow it out.</p>
  <input id="wtext" maxlength="140" placeholder="Type your wish here" aria-label="Your wish" style="max-width:360px;width:92%">
  <svg id="candle" class="candle" viewBox="0 0 80 130" role="img" aria-label="Candle"><ellipse cx="40" cy="123" rx="30" ry="6" fill="#4A2A6B" opacity=".2"/><rect x="28" y="58" width="24" height="64" rx="6" fill="#FF9EC4" stroke="#4A2A6B" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M28 74q6 8 12 0t12 0" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="38" y="46" width="4" height="13" fill="#4A2A6B"/><path id="wf" class="wf off" d="M40 8C54 26 52 44 40 47C28 44 26 26 40 8Z" fill="#FF9F1C" stroke="#F5B94A" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
  <button class="btn" id="wbtn">Light the candle</button>
  <div id="wstat" style="font-weight:700"></div>
  <div id="wdots" style="font-size:1.3rem"></div>
</section>
</div>

<script src="script.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>